id: four-witches-grip
name: Four Witches Grip
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score of 6+
tpCost: 4
source: Core Rule
description: >
  In the Multiple Arms Special State, every Grapple Check 1(T) higher - as the Grappler or the Grappled.
text: >
  Four Witches Grip: Thanks to your extra arms, you are able to grapple more effectively.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 6+
  –TP Cost: 4
  –Effect: While in the Multiple Arms Special State, increase all of your Grapple Checks by 1(T).

---

# "All of your Grapple Checks": either side of one (chat.mjs, the Strike Clash's rows when it is a Grapple Check).
[passive]
if (inState("multiple-arms")) {
  grapple.all += 1(T);
}
